00:20:15,900 --> 00:20:19,440
Sakurai-kun...You probably
shouldn't talk to me.

258
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,370
Huh? Why not?

259
00:20:21,370 --> 00:20:25,310
Someone bad has it in for me...

260
00:20:25,310 --> 00:20:30,210
-Who's that?
-Some weird transfer student.

261
00:20:36,290 --> 00:20:39,760
Hey, transfer student.
Come to the back of the campus.

262
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:43,090
We'll teach you how things are done
at East Ihara Middle School.

263
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:47,730
I see. So you're the Hyodo Gang.

264
00:20:47,730 --> 00:20:50,870
The culprits who make life
at school miserable.

265
00:20:50,870 --> 00:20:52,670
You cocky bastard!

266
00:20:54,710 --> 00:20:56,710
Why you-!

267
00:20:56,710 --> 00:20:58,470
Bastard!

268
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,340
Tanaka-kun!

269
00:21:06,590 --> 00:21:07,850
Your face!

270
00:21:07,850 --> 00:21:12,190
I wanted to give this to you.
It's Dying Breed's Germany concert.

271
00:21:13,190 --> 00:21:15,060
Sakurai-kun...

272
00:21:17,260 --> 00:21:20,930
I told you it was bad to talk to me...

273
00:21:20,930 --> 00:21:25,600
Did you read the Eddie Lee
interview in Guitar World?

274
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:30,740
Yeah. Eddie's Telecaster was cool.

275
00:21:30,740 --> 00:21:33,650
There are two types of people in this world.

276
00:21:33,650 --> 00:21:35,150
Huh?

277
00:21:35,150 --> 00:21:38,250
Clever people and obedient people.

278
00:21:38,250 --> 00:21:45,420
Clever people think man-made laws
and morals make the world work.

279
00:21:45,420 --> 00:21:49,160
But I don't bother with any of that.

280
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:51,200
Eddie is amazing, huh?

281
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,790
Oww!

282
00:21:55,840 --> 00:21:58,700
Won't you come see
our band practice sometime?

283
00:21:58,700 --> 00:22:01,700
So you're in a band?

284
00:22:30,540 --> 00:22:36,040
Ryusuke said earlier that he wants
to make the band's sound hotter.

285
00:22:36,040 --> 00:22:39,370
He intends to bring Koyuki into Beck...

